  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />(As both parts have some P.D.) upper capacitor have capacitance<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&epsilon;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math><br />Lower capacitor<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&epsilon;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&there4;</mo></math> equivalent capacitance<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&there4;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />And <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
